<title>JAPAN: Kitano Construction - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kitano Construction - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 29.24		vs	   34.78</p>
<p> Operating	    1.10		vs	    1.29</p>
<p> Current		1.08		vs	    1.40</p>
